{"meta":{"id":"redirect","category":"it/syntax/spring/controller","title":"컨트롤러 이동 (redirect:) · Spring","subtitle":"(SPRING)","summary":"redirect:/주소?키=값, redirect:/주소/값, RedirectAttributes","tags":["spring","f-navigation"],"color":"emerald","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-emerald","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-emerald-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>SPRING</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">컨트롤러 이동 (redirect:) · Spring</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> redirect:/주소?키=값, redirect:/주소/값, RedirectAttributes</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">다른 컨트롤러로 이동 — redirect:</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">@RequestMapping(value = &quot;/c1Service&quot;, method = RequestMethod.GET)\r\npublic String c1ServiceGet() {\r\n    // return &quot;ctom/c1&quot;;                         // 화면(jsp)으로 이동 (forward)\r\n    return &quot;redirect:/컨트롤러명?키값=값&quot;;        // 1. 쿼리스트링으로 전달\r\n    // return &quot;redirect:/컨트롤러명/값/값&quot;;       // 2. @PathVariable 로 받기\r\n}\r\n\r\n// 값을 한 번만 전달 (새로고침 시 사라짐)\r\npublic String save(RedirectAttributes ra) {\r\n    ra.addFlashAttribute(&quot;msg&quot;, &quot;저장 완료&quot;);\r\n    return &quot;redirect:/list&quot;;\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> Java › 페이지 이동 (forward · redirect), JSP › 페이지 이동</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/spring/controller/redirect","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"spring","title":"SPRING","path":"it/syntax/spring"},{"id":"controller","title":"컨트롤러 · 데이터 통신","path":"it/syntax/spring/controller"}],"hasImage":false}